      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "算了",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "行，那咱就这样安静待着也挺好",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "哦",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "又一个\"哦\"，感觉你在考验我的耐心😏",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "有吗",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "没有，是我自己多想了，脑子闲着容易胡思乱想",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "...",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "发省略号是想我陪你说话还是想静静待着",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "都行",
        "phase": "phase_3"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "那我就当你是都行，随时切换模式这种人设我很欣赏☺️",
        "phase": "phase_3"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "嗯",
        "phase": "phase_3"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "对了，平时晚上这个点一般干嘛消遣",
